# Do NOT ignore assets/. pub.dev resolves relative README image paths against
# the published archive, and only then rewrites the src to the `repository`
# URL to serve the bytes. Excluding the PNGs makes pub.dev drop the images
# from the rendered README entirely (this happened in 0.2.2). Keep them here
# and keep them small via `node tool/render_preview.js --optimize-only`.

benchmark/
tool/
coverage/
firebase-debug.log
*.iml
.idea/
